                "text": "\ud83c\udfe5 Strengthening and preserving health care programs and hospitals.\n\n\u2705 $500 million secured for Alabama's 54 rural hospitals.\n\u2705 Medicaid Provider Tax frozen at 6% for non-expansion states, like Alabama.\n\u2705 Commonsense work requirements for Medicaid.",
